"Discovery stage: the toolkit reads the game; the translation catalog "
"comes later."
msgstr ""
"Стадия исследования: инструментарий читает игру; каталог перевода "
"появится позже."

#. js/start.js
msgctxt "site:drafting only"
msgid "drafting only"
msgstr "только черновики"

#. js/submit.js
msgctxt "site:The pictures travel in the JSON file."
msgid "The pictures travel in the JSON file."
msgstr "Картинки передаются в файле JSON."

#. js/submit.js
msgctxt "site:The glyph redraws travel in the JSON file."
msgid "The glyph redraws travel in the JSON file."
msgstr "Перерисованные глифы передаются в файле JSON."

#. js/terms.js
msgctxt "site:notes and sources only"
msgid "notes and sources only"
msgstr "только заметки и источники"

#. js/gametext.js
msgctxt ""
"site:The UPS patch produced SHA-1 {sha1}. Expected SHA-1 {expected}."
msgid "The UPS patch produced SHA-1 {sha1}. Expected SHA-1 {expected}."
msgstr "UPS-патч создал ROM с SHA-1 {sha1}. Ожидаемый SHA-1: {expected}."

#. editor.html
msgctxt "site:Translated entries"
msgid "Translated entries"
msgstr "Переведённые записи"

#. editor.html, js/enginerules.js, js/pick.js
msgctxt "site:Translated"
msgid "Translated"
msgstr "Переведено"

#. submit.html
msgctxt ""
"site:The changes are written into the files of the project on a branch "
"that names the issue."
msgid ""
"The changes are written into the files of the project on a branch that "
"names the issue."
msgstr "Изменения записываются в файлы проекта в ветке с номером задачи."

#. submit.html
msgctxt "site:A maintainer merges it"
msgid "A maintainer merges it"
msgstr "Сопровождающий сливает пул-реквест"

#. submit.html
msgctxt ""
"site:A maintainer reviews the pull request and merges it. After the merge "
"a new translation has the status Translated; a text that was Approved "
"stays Approved."
msgid ""
"A maintainer reviews the pull request and merges it. After the merge a "
"new translation has the status Translated; a text that was Approved stays "
"Approved."
msgstr ""
"Сопровождающий проекта проверяет пул-реквест и сливает его. После слияния "
"новый перевод получает статус «Переведено»; текст со статусом «Одобрено» "
"сохраняет его."

#. submit.html
msgctxt ""
"site:Translated and approved texts enter the next version of the "
"translation patch, listed on the patcher page."
msgid ""
"Translated and approved texts enter the next version of the translation "
"patch, listed on the patcher page."
msgstr ""
"Переведённые и одобренные тексты войдут в следующую версию патча "
"перевода, доступную на странице патчера."

#. submit.html
msgctxt "site:A playtest approves it"
msgid "A playtest approves it"
msgstr "Проверка в игре одобряет тексты"

#. submit.html
msgctxt ""
"site:After a version is played and reported in an issue of the game "
"project, its translated texts become Approved."
msgid ""
"After a version is played and reported in an issue of the game project, "
"its translated texts become Approved."
msgstr ""
"Когда версию проверят в игре и сообщат об этом в задаче проекта игры, её "
"переведённые тексты получат статус «Одобрено»."

#. js/data.js
msgctxt "site:translated"
msgid "translated"
msgstr "переведено"

#. js/editor/context.js
msgctxt ""
"site:Save drafts writes text to the catalog and keeps note proposals "
"inactive; a new translation is saved as translated, an approved text "
"stays approved"
msgid ""
"Save drafts writes text to the catalog and keeps note proposals inactive; "
"a new translation is saved as translated, an approved text stays approved"
msgstr ""
"«Сохранить черновики» записывает текст в каталог, а предложения заметок "
"сохраняет неактивными; новый перевод получает статус «Переведено», "
"одобренный текст остаётся одобренным"

#. js/site-model.js
msgctxt ""
"site:{translated} of {total} entries the game shows are translated, "
"{approved} of them approved; left out: {never} never shown (reach study "
"and reviews), {nothing} with nothing to translate"
msgid ""
"{translated} of {total} entries the game shows are translated, {approved} "
"of them approved; left out: {never} never shown (reach study and "
"reviews), {nothing} with nothing to translate"
msgstr ""
"Переведено записей, которые показывает игра: {translated} из {total}, из "
"них одобрено: {approved}; не учитываются: никогда не показываются — "
"{never} (исследование достижимости и рецензии), нечего переводить — "
"{nothing}"

#. js/site-model.js
msgctxt ""
"site:{entries} entries · {translated}% translated · {approved}% approved"
msgid "{entries} entries · {translated}% translated · {approved}% approved"
msgstr ""
"Записей: {entries} · переведено {translated}% · одобрено {approved}%"

#. js/terms.js
msgctxt ""
"site:{lines} lines change ({approved} approved, {translated} translated); "
"each line keeps its status"
msgid ""
"{lines} lines change ({approved} approved, {translated} translated); each "
"line keeps its status"
msgstr ""
"Меняется строк: {lines} (одобренных: {approved}, переведённых: "
"{translated}); статус каждой строки сохраняется"

#. index.html
msgctxt ""
"site:Apply a site translation or your own UPS, IPS, BPS, xdelta, APS or "
"PPF patch."
msgid ""
"Apply a site translation or your own UPS, IPS, BPS, xdelta, APS or PPF "
"patch."
msgstr ""
"Примените перевод с сайта или свой патч UPS, IPS, BPS, xdelta, APS или "
"PPF."

#. index.html
msgctxt ""
"site:Apply a site translation with its original ROM, or your own UPS, "
"IPS, BPS, xdelta, APS or PPF patch. Files stay in your browser. "
"Translation releases check the ROM and result hashes. UPS patches also "
"work with {tool}."
msgid ""
"Apply a site translation with its original ROM, or your own UPS, IPS, "
"BPS, xdelta, APS or PPF patch. Files stay in your browser. Translation "
"releases check the ROM and result hashes. UPS patches also work with "
"{tool}."
msgstr ""
"Примените перевод с сайта к исходному ROM или свой патч UPS, IPS, BPS, "
"xdelta, APS или PPF. Файлы остаются в браузере. Для релизов перевода "
"проверяются хеши исходного ROM и результата. Патчи UPS также можно "
"применить в {tool}."

#. js/patch-engine.js
msgctxt "site:This is not a UPS, IPS, BPS, xdelta, APS or PPF patch."
msgid "This is not a UPS, IPS, BPS, xdelta, APS or PPF patch."
msgstr "Это не патч UPS, IPS, BPS, xdelta, APS или PPF."

#. js/patch-engine.js
msgctxt ""
"site:This xdelta patch is packed with a method this page cannot read."
msgid "This xdelta patch is packed with a method this page cannot read."
msgstr "Этот патч xdelta сжат способом, который страница не читает."

#. js/patch-engine.js
msgctxt ""
"site:This xdelta patch carries its own code table, which this page cannot "
"read."
msgid ""
"This xdelta patch carries its own code table, which this page cannot read."
msgstr ""
"Этот патч xdelta содержит собственную кодовую таблицу, которую страница "
"не читает."

#. js/patch-engine.js
msgctxt ""
"site:The patch was made for another ROM: expected checksum {expected}, "
"got {actual}."
msgid ""
"The patch was made for another ROM: expected checksum {expected}, got "
"{actual}."
msgstr ""
"Патч создан для другого ROM: ожидается контрольная сумма {expected}, "
"получена {actual}."

#. js/patch-engine.js
msgctxt ""
"site:The patch was made for another ROM: the data at offset {offset} "
"differs."
msgid ""
"The patch was made for another ROM: the data at offset {offset} differs."
msgstr ""
"Патч создан для другого ROM: данные по смещению {offset} отличаются."

#. js/patch-engine.js
msgctxt ""
"site:The patch was made for another ROM: its BLAKE3 digest differs from "
"the one in the patch."
msgid ""
"The patch was made for another ROM: its BLAKE3 digest differs from the "
"one in the patch."
msgstr ""
"Патч создан для другого ROM: его дайджест BLAKE3 не совпадает с указанным "
"в патче."

#. js/patch-engine.js
msgctxt ""
"site:The patch is damaged: the result differs from the BLAKE3 digest in "
"the patch."
msgid ""
"The patch is damaged: the result differs from the BLAKE3 digest in the "
"patch."
msgstr ""
"Патч повреждён: результат не совпадает с дайджестом BLAKE3 из патча."

#. js/patch.js
msgctxt "site:Result confirmed by the checksum in the patch."
msgid "Result confirmed by the checksum in the patch."
msgstr "Результат подтверждён контрольной суммой из патча."

#. js/patch-engine.js
msgctxt ""
"site:The result does not match the checksum in the patch (expected "
"{expected}, got {actual}): the ROM is another one or the patch is damaged."
msgid ""
"The result does not match the checksum in the patch (expected {expected}, "
"got {actual}): the ROM is another one or the patch is damaged."
msgstr ""
"Результат не совпадает с контрольной суммой из патча (ожидается "
"{expected}, получена {actual}): это другой ROM или патч повреждён."

#. js/patch.js
msgctxt ""
"site:{format} patches carry no checksum of the result, so the result "
"cannot be confirmed."
msgid ""
"{format} patches carry no checksum of the result, so the result cannot be "
"confirmed."
msgstr ""
"В патчах {format} нет контрольной суммы результата, поэтому результат "
"подтвердить нельзя."

#. js/patch.js
msgctxt ""
"site:Result not confirmed: the patch carries no checksum of the whole "
"result."
msgid ""
"Result not confirmed: the patch carries no checksum of the whole result."
msgstr ""
"Результат не подтверждён: в патче нет контрольной суммы всего результата."

#. js/patch.js
msgctxt ""
"site:To keep playing an existing save, rename it to {save}, or to the "
"same name ending in .srm for a .srm save. An emulator loads a save only "
"when it has the ROM's name."
msgid ""
"To keep playing an existing save, rename it to {save}, or to the same "
"name ending in .srm for a .srm save. An emulator loads a save only when "
"it has the ROM's name."
msgstr ""
"Чтобы продолжить игру с прежним сохранением, переименуйте его в {save}, а "
"файл .srm — в то же имя с расширением .srm. Эмулятор загружает "
"сохранение, только если его имя совпадает с именем ROM."

#. js/save.js
msgctxt ""
"site:Before loading {file}, rename it to your ROM's name with the "
"extension {ext}. An emulator loads a save only when it has the ROM's "
"name. Keep the original save as a backup."
msgid ""
"Before loading {file}, rename it to your ROM's name with the extension "
"{ext}. An emulator loads a save only when it has the ROM's name. Keep the "
"original save as a backup."
msgstr ""
"Перед загрузкой дайте файлу {file} имя вашего ROM с расширением {ext}. "
"Эмулятор загружает сохранение, только если его имя совпадает с именем "
"ROM. Исходное сохранение оставьте как резервную копию."

